# CLAUDE.md - Project Context & Skills

## Project Overview

**SEO Metadata Platform** - A full-stack application for SEO/GEO/AEO analysis and optimization of web pages.

### Core Pipeline

```
1. INGEST: POST /api/v1/ingest/url → scrape HTML → store in ingested_urls
2. ANALYZE: POST /api/v1/analyze/{id} → LangGraph + Gemini → store in url_analyses
3. OPTIMIZE: POST /api/v1/optimize/{analysis_id} → LangGraph + Gemini + Serper → store in url_optimizations
```

### Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Backend | FastAPI + Python 3.12 + Pydantic v2 + SQLAlchemy 2.x async + Alembic |
| Database | PostgreSQL 16 (asyncpg driver) |
| AI/LLM | LangGraph + LangChain + Google Gemini (gemini-3.5-flash-lite) |
| Web Search | Serper API |
| Web Scraping | httpx + BeautifulSoup4 + Playwright (fallback) |
| Frontend | Next.js 15 + React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS |
| Testing | pytest + httpx (backend), Vitest + Playwright (frontend) |

## Architecture

### Backend Structure

```
backend/src/
├── api/          # FastAPI routers (ingest, analysis, optimization, health, items, categories, periods)
├── models/       # SQLAlchemy models (IngestedUrl, UrlAnalysis, UrlOptimization, Item, Category, Period, Dealer)
├── schemas/      # Pydantic schemas
├── services/     # Business logic + LangGraph orchestration
│   ├── ingest_service.py      # Web scraping (httpx + Playwright fallback)
│   ├── graph_nodes.py         # Analysis LangGraph nodes (parse_html, analyze_seo_geo, generate_json_ld, compile_report)
│   ├── analysis_service.py    # Analysis orchestrator
│   ├── optimizer_nodes.py     # Optimizer LangGraph nodes (read_analysis, search_web, plan_changes, apply_changes, compile_optimization)
│   └── optimizer_service.py   # Optimizer orchestrator
├── middleware/   # Auth, logging, error handling
└── db/           # Session management
```

### Database Tables

| Table | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `ingested_urls` | Scraped HTML + metadata (url, html, status, http_status, content_type) |
| `url_analyses` | SEO/GEO analysis results (seo_score, geo_score, overall_score, analysis JSONB, json_ld JSONB) |
| `url_optimizations` | Optimization results (optimized_html, optimized_json_ld, optimized_content, changes, scores) |
| `items`, `categories`, `periods`, `dealers` | Legacy catalog data |

### LangGraph Pipelines

**Analysis Graph (4 nodes):**
```
parse_html → analyze_seo_geo → generate_json_ld → compile_report
```

**Optimizer Graph (5 nodes):**
```
read_analysis → search_web → plan_changes → apply_changes → compile_optimization
```

## API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/v1/ingest/url` | Scrape URL and store HTML |
| GET | `/api/v1/ingest/url/{id}` | Get ingested URL with HTML |
| GET | `/api/v1/ingest/urls` | List ingested URLs |
